Lume GF: a channel change closes the old stream before the next one opens.
KSMEPlayer.replace hands the new item the one it replaces; the new item's open waits (at most 1.5 s) until the old
item's close operation has closed its input, so two TVs zapping on a two-connection account never wait for each other.
Test: LumeTests GFZapTests (local stream server). Made against KSPlayer bdfa2da (deps/KSPlayer/REVISION).

diff --git a/Sources/KSPlayer/MEPlayer/KSMEPlayer.swift b/Sources/KSPlayer/MEPlayer/KSMEPlayer.swift
